WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:16.388
and Kaleem were on their way to their friend Grace's house.

2
00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:20.089
Beatrice was sitting on Daisy's headband.

3
00:00:20.949 --> 00:00:25.010
"Mrs. Ortiz has been in the hospital for a long time," Kaleem said.

4
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:27.411
"I hope she's going to be okay."

5
00:00:27.431 --> 00:00:30.212
"Me too," Daisy said.

6
00:00:31.576 --> 00:00:34.938
"I'm glad you're helping that dog, Daisy," Beatrice said.

7
00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:38.219
"I'm sure it makes that poor old lady feel better."

8
00:00:38.239 --> 00:00:41.160
"I hope so," Daisy said.

9
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.001
"Me too," Beatrice said.

10
00:00:44.021 --> 00:00:49.004
"Because it's almost time for me to report to the council—Oops, never mind!"

11
00:00:49.024 --> 00:00:52.525
"Huh?" Daisy was confused.

12
00:00:53.405 --> 00:00:56.227
She wanted to ask Beatrice what she was talking about.

13
00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:58.968
But just then Grace hurried toward them.

14
00:01:00.476 --> 00:01:01.357
"Hi, you guys!

15
00:01:01.837 --> 00:01:03.178
Let's go see Scamp!"

16
00:01:10.523 --> 00:01:13.285
Soon the three kids were letting Scamp out of the house.

17
00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:17.348
He ran to his pool and leaped in.

18
00:01:19.389 --> 00:01:20.930
Water splashed everywhere.

19
00:01:23.452 --> 00:01:25.794
Beatrice buzzed as the water drenched her.

20
00:01:25.814 --> 00:01:29.016
"Ugh! I hate water!"

21
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.161
Grace looked at Daisy.

22
00:01:31.181 --> 00:01:34.645
"Is that a bee on your headband, Daisy?"

23
00:01:34.665 --> 00:01:37.527
"It's a pin," Daisy said quickly.

24
00:01:38.368 --> 00:01:39.989
She didn't like lying to Grace.

25
00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:41.891
But what else could she do?

26
00:01:41.911 --> 00:01:45.014
"Oh," Grace said, peering at it.

27
00:01:45.034 --> 00:01:47.636
"It looks so real.

28
00:01:48.397 --> 00:01:52.180
You probably know this already—bumblebees have five eyes."

29
00:01:53.221 --> 00:01:54.082
Daisy nodded.

30
00:01:54.102 --> 00:01:56.264
"Bumblebees are really cool."

31
00:02:00.588 --> 00:02:05.590
"Bzzz!" Daisy hurried over to Kaleem before Grace noticed anything strange about her "pin."

32
00:02:06.451 --> 00:02:08.892
Kaleem was tossing a ball for Scamp to fetch.

33
00:02:09.292 --> 00:02:12.833
The dog splashed through the pool each time he ran after it.

34
00:02:13.794 --> 00:02:14.694
Daisy smiled.

35
00:02:14.714 --> 00:02:18.216
"You're splashing all the water out of your pool, Scamp!"

36
00:02:18.236 --> 00:02:21.317
"I can't help it," Scamp said.

37
00:02:21.337 --> 00:02:24.318
"I love playing in the water!"

38
00:02:25.119 --> 00:02:26.119
The back door of Mrs.

39
00:02:26.199 --> 00:02:28.040
Ortiz's house suddenly opened.

40
00:02:29.084 --> 00:02:31.705
A man with dark hair came out and waved to Grace.

41
00:02:31.725 --> 00:02:33.526
"Hello, Grace!

42
00:02:34.006 --> 00:02:34.706
Do you remember me?

43
00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:35.687
I'm Mrs.

44
00:02:35.767 --> 00:02:36.907
Ortiz's son, Philip."

45
00:02:36.927 --> 00:02:39.889
"Hi," Grace said softly.

46
00:02:40.709 --> 00:02:42.289
Scamp ran over to the man.

47
00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:43.890
"Hi, Philip!"

48
00:02:45.511 --> 00:02:46.551
He barked happily.

49
00:02:46.571 --> 00:02:49.332
"You came to visit me today!

50
00:02:49.793 --> 00:02:51.433
Where are Alex and Olivia?"

51
00:02:52.274 --> 00:02:54.955
Daisy wanted to ask who Alex and Olivia were.

52
00:02:55.415 --> 00:02:57.756
But that would give away her secret, of course.

53
00:02:59.852 --> 00:03:00.432
"How is Mrs.

54
00:03:00.492 --> 00:03:01.333
Ortiz doing?"

55
00:03:01.653 --> 00:03:02.354
Kaleem asked.

56
00:03:02.374 --> 00:03:05.195
"She's feeling much better, thanks."

57
00:03:06.156 --> 00:03:07.076
Philip smiled.

58
00:03:07.096 --> 00:03:10.958
"But our family has discussed the situation, and we've made a big decision.

59
00:03:12.219 --> 00:03:14.320
My mother shouldn't live here alone anymore.

60
00:03:15.001 --> 00:03:16.602
She's going to move in with me and my wife.

61
00:03:17.442 --> 00:03:20.744
Our kids, Alex and Olivia, are excited to have their grandma live with us.

62
00:03:21.384 --> 00:03:23.425
Luckily we have a spare bedroom in our condo."

63
00:03:23.445 --> 00:03:27.628
"Oh, that sounds wonderful," Daisy said.

64
00:03:29.212 --> 00:03:32.155
"Yes," Grace said softly, looking down.

65
00:03:32.175 --> 00:03:34.376
"But I'll miss having Mrs.

66
00:03:34.436 --> 00:03:37.018
Ortiz and Scamp living next door to us."

67
00:03:39.701 --> 00:03:41.482
"I'll miss Grace too!"

68
00:03:43.864 --> 00:03:44.645
Scamp barked.

69
00:03:44.665 --> 00:03:47.947
"And I'll miss my yard and my pool.

70
00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:50.709
But I love Alex and Olivia!

71
00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:53.311
We'll have fun all the time!"

72
00:03:54.392 --> 00:03:56.394
Daisy smiled and winked at the dog.

73
00:03:57.255 --> 00:03:59.509
Then she looked up at Philip.

74
00:03:59.529 --> 00:04:02.132
"I bet Scamp will love living with you and your kids."

75
00:04:02.914 --> 00:04:03.915
Philip shook his head.

76
00:04:03.935 --> 00:04:06.819
"Actually, Scamp won't be moving in with us.

77
00:04:07.761 --> 00:04:09.924
Our condo complex doesn't allow dogs."

78
00:04:10.545 --> 00:04:11.166
He shrugged.

79
00:04:11.186 --> 00:04:15.211
"It's a shame, but we'll have to find Scamp another home."
